                                "sense_id": "667ccc40-3072-32b3-804b-3ca8de2955fc",
                                "text": "'I suppose you're referring to Fluker,' I told him, and he looked at me in stunned amazement when I explained that he was one of my old oppoes.",
                                "translation": "“我想你指的是弗卢克吧，”我告诉他，当我解释说他是我以前的朋友之一时，他惊讶地看着我。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fce1076e-862a-493e-bc24-8870a81367c8",
                                "sense_id": "667ccc40-3072-32b3-804b-3ca8de2955fc",
                                "text": "“It's all right, chaps, the decorator's come. This 'ere is me old ’oppo Ginger Vernall.”",
                                "translation": "“伙计们，没事了，油漆工来了。这是我的老朋友金杰·弗纳尔。”"
                            }
                        ]
